#. {ph0}: <span class="flow-label">
#. {ph1}: </span >
#. {ph2}: <span class="flow-node">
#. {ph3}: <code>notes:export</code>
#. {ph4}: </span >
#. {ph5}: <span class="flow-note" >
#. {ph6}: </span >
#: website/public/guides/javascript/index.html:244
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/javascript/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Between processes{ph1}{ph2}{ph3}{ph4}{ph5}The preload invokes an IPC "
"channel: a named message to the main process.{ph6}"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}프로세스 간 통신{ph1}{ph2}{ph3}{ph4}{ph5}프리로드는 메인 프로세스로 보내는 이름 있는 메시지인 IPC 채널을"
" 호출합니다.{ph6}"

#. {ph0}: <span class="flow-label">
#. {ph1}: </span >
#. {ph2}: <span class="flow-node">
#. {ph3}: </span >
#. {ph4}: <span class="flow-note" >
#. {ph5}: <code>main.js</code>
#. {ph6}: </span >
#: website/public/guides/javascript/index.html:252
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/javascript/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Main process{ph1}{ph2}An export handler{ph3}{ph4}{ph5} handles that "
"channel and calls the CSV writer.{ph6}"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}메인 프로세스{ph1}{ph2}내보내기 핸들러{ph3}{ph4}{ph5}이 해당 채널을 처리하고 CSV 저장 함수를 "
"호출합니다.{ph6}"

#. {ph0}: <code>csv.js</code>
#. {ph1}: <code>main.js</code>
#. {ph2}: <code>downloads/notes.csv</code>
#: website/public/guides/javascript/index.html:261
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/javascript/index.html"
msgid "{ph0} formats the notes → {ph1} writes {ph2}."
msgstr "{ph0}이 메모를 변환 → {ph1}이 {ph2} 저장."

#: website/public/guides/javascript/index.html:265
msgctxt "page:guides/javascript/index.html"
msgid ""
"REA matches the literal IPC call to its handler and identifies the exposed "
"API. The path is inferred from code; a runtime capture can check what "
"executes."
msgstr ""
