#: website/public/index.html:457
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid "01 · Which branch?"
msgstr "01 · 어떤 분기인가요?"

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/index.html:458
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid ""
"“{ph0}0x5b? 0x5c?{ph1} Two jumps to the same place. Which operators are "
"these?”"
msgstr "“{ph0}0x5b? 0x5c?{ph1} 두 점프가 같은 위치로 향합니다. 이들은 어떤 연산자일까요?”"

#: website/public/index.html:462
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid "Look up the command IDs, then label the branch."
msgstr "명령 ID를 찾아 분기가 뜻하는 연산을 표시합니다."

#: website/public/index.html:468
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid "Divide ÷"
msgstr "나누기 ÷"

#: website/public/index.html:472
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid "Multiply ×"
msgstr "곱하기 ×"

#: website/public/index.html:477
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid "02 · What do the calls do?"
msgstr "02 · 호출된 함수는 무엇을 하나요?"

#. {ph0}: <strong >
#. {ph1}: </strong >
#: website/public/index.html:478
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:index.html"
msgid ""
"“100 is clear. The calls are just addresses. {ph0}Which one divides? Which "
